    "chunk_text": "am regole, \u00fee us gewissa\u00f0 be \u00fe\u00e6re halgan eastertide, \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre ne sy se halga Wite nu for\u00f0i gif hit w\u00e6re rihtlice emniht on Marian m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g, \u00fe\u00e6t se d\u00e6g ne gelumpe n\u00e6fre ofer Us is neod \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00f0a halgan eastertide be \u00f0am so\u00f0um regole healdon n\u00e6fre \u00e6r emnihte, & For\u00f0i we secga\u00f0 so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t seo emniht is swa swa we \u00e6r cw\u00e6don on XII a kalendas aprilis, swa swa Eac \u00f0a o\u00f0re \u00fereo tida \u00fe\u00e6t is se sumerlica sunstede, & se winterlica, & seo h\u00e6rfestlice emniht sind to Witodlice se emnihtes d\u00e6g is eallum middanearde an & gelice lang, & ealle o\u00f0re dagas on twelf On sumum earde hi beo\u00f0 lengran, on sumum scyrtran for \u00f0\u00e6re eor\u00f0an sceadewunge, & \u00f0\u00e6re sunnan Seo eor\u00f0e stent on gelicnysse anre pinnhnyte, & seo sunne glit onbutan be Godes gesetnysse, & on Nu is \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00f0an sinewealtnys, & \u00f0\u00e6re sunnan ymbgang, hremming \u00fe\u00e6t se d\u00e6g ne bi\u00f0 on \u00e6lcum On India lande wenda\u00f0 heora sceada on sumera su\u00f0weard & on wintra nor\u00f0weard. Eft on Alexandria g\u00e6\u00f0 seo sunne upprihte on \u00f0am sumerlicum sunstede on midd\u00e6ge, & ne bi\u00f0 nan \u00d0is ylce getima\u00f0 eac on sumum o\u00f0rum stowum. Meroe hatte an igland, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00f0\u00e6ra Silhearwena eard; on \u00f0am iglande h\u00e6f\u00f0 se lengsta d\u00e6g on geare On \u00f0",
